----                             7095  ; Native AmigaOS opForge CLI shell.
----                             7096  ;
----                             7097  ; This first slice mirrors the Rust CLI argument names for a strict native
----                             7098  ; subset and provides deterministic stage stubs until parser/emitter VMs exist
